Subject: [PATCH] contrib: samsung-gtactive3wifi Duranium build and install

Build the bring-up kernel tarball (build-kernel.sh), build the local
device/kernel/usb-debug apks and run mkosi against the local pmaports
worktree (build-image.sh), and stream the image into the Android userdata
partition sda31 over the bring-up console with verification
(install-to-userdata.sh). README documents the nested-GPT-in-userdata
layout, the phosh UI choice, sizing and the USB debug layer.

